<title>ISRAEL: IDB Development Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>IDB Development Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDB Development Corp, a subsidiary of IDB Holding Corp, reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except per share)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  470,434    450,256</p>
<p>Pretax profit	  145,841    131,574</p>
<p>Net profit		63,661     66,099</p>
<p>Earnings per share     1.40	 1.46</p>
<p>($1=3.395 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
